<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $185 mln repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $185 mln repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it placed $185 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money fell to 7.05 percent from 7.50 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99983 pesos from 0.99982 pesos Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
